ublic","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":5614220,"digest":"sha256:cf03de597c7e1e637732b3a38af047f91a8c2cf77b4b2dd3a60ddbd53783dd6a","download_count":9,"created_at":"2026-10-09T09:38:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T09:38:40Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/thibautbus/top/releases/download/v1.1.0/the-oracles-project-1.1.0-macos.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibautbus/top/releases/assets/624523577","id":624523577,"node_id":"RA_kwDOUu1oGM4lOXk5","name":"the-oracles-project-1.1.0-windows.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":3632020,"digest":"sha256:fb66dd95dc7399fc75c5eb31ab49e080ab694a765f76637360697fe789cebcc5","download_count":115,"created_at":"2026-10-09T09:38:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T09:38:40Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/thibautbus/top/releases/download/v1.1.0/the-oracles-project-1.1.0-windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibautbus/top/tarball/v1.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibautbus/top/zipball/v1.1.0","body":"A faithful, moddable port of Oracle of Ages and Oracle of Seasons for PC, macOS and Android. Your own ROM runs in an emulator core: [SameBoy](https://sameboy.github.io/), unmodified, the accurate reference, or [mGBA](https://mgba.io/)'s Game Boy core, lighter, with one patch (its boot ROM), for small devices; Fast (mGBA) plays by default on Android, Accurate (SameBoy) elsewhere, and Core, in Display's Advanced page, changes it. Around it, a native host observes the game and presents it: the original image, or a widescreen view with the neighbouring rooms, at three levels, Near, Medium and Far, in the shape of the screen, 16:9 or 4:3; Display's Quality sets the view and the core for the device in one choice, from Low to Max. Gameplay options, Lua mods and fan games from their BPS patch come with it.\r\n\r\nThe game needs your own ROM of Oracle of Ages or Oracle of Seasons (US), and a fan game its BPS patch; none is included.\r\n\r\n## Installing\r\n\r\n- **Windows** (`the-oracles-project-1.1.0-windows.zip`, 64-bit): unzip the folder and run `the-oracles-project.exe`. The executable is not signed, so SmartScreen may warn the first time: More info, then Run anyway.\r\n- **macOS** (`the-oracles-project-1.1.0-macos.zip`, one application for Apple Silicon and Intel, macOS 11 or later): unzip and move The Oracles Project to Applications. The application is not notarised: open it the first time by right-clicking it and choosing Open, or run `xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine \"The Oracles Project.app\"`.\r\n- **Linux** (`the-oracles-project-1.1.0-linux-x86_64.tar.gz`): extract the folder and run `./the-oracles-project`; SDL 3 comes with it. The `the-oracles-project.desktop` file inside is optional: set its two paths, then copy it to `~/.local/share/applications/`.\r\n- **Android** (`the-oracles-project-1.1.0-android.apk`, Android 10 or later): install the APK, allowing its installation from your browser or file manager when Android asks.\r\n\r\n`SHA256SUMS.txt` holds the SHA-256 of each file.\r\n\r\n## What's new in 1.1.0\r\n\r\n- **Two cores.** The games run on SameBoy (Accurate) as well as mGBA's Game Boy core (Fast), behind one interface; Fast plays by default on Android. Display's Advanced page chooses the core.\r\n- **Three views in the shape of the screen.** The widescreen view has three levels, Near, Medium and Far, in 16:9 and in 4:3, and the launcher has a 4:3 layout.\r\n- **Quality.** Display's Quality sets the view and the core for the device in one choice, Low to Max, chosen by the device at the first opening; after a game that ran slowly, the launcher suggests a lighter one.\r\n- **Neighbouring rooms.** Two background instances prepare the rooms around (Neighbor workers, in Display's Advanced page); a neighbour is rendered again only when what it reads has changed; the rooms of the past stay drawn across time warps; the view follows the screen shake and full fades, and keeps the neighbours' animations in step and their rooms when the colour correction changes.\r\n- **Controllers.** Every controller is read, and controllers are opened again after a game.\r\n- **Fixes.** A diagonal walk no longer wobbles Link in the widescreen view; vsync stays off on Android when it is set to auto; the launcher writes its report to a file on Android.\r\n- Settings files and saves of 1.0.0 still load, and 1.1.0 installs over 1.0.0 on Android.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thibautbus/top/releases/407767430/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}